{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChCxxp8EDL7bxWYwDsmxz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let T(n) be the number of ordered compositions of n into parts 1, 2, and 3. The last part is 1, 2, or 3, so T(n) = T(n-1) + T(n-2) + T(n-3), with T(0) = 1 (the empty sum), T(1) = 1, and T(2) = 2.\n\nBuilding up:\n- T(3) = 2 + 1 + 1 = 4\n- T(4) = 4 + 2 + 1 = 7\n- T(5) = 7 + 4 + 2 = 13\n- T(6) = 13 + 7 + 4 = 24\n- T(7) = 24 + 13 + 7 = 44\n- T(8) = 44 + 24 + 13 = 81\n- T(9) = 81 + 44 + 24 = 149\n- T(10) = 149 + 81 + 44 = 274\n- T(11) = 274 + 149 + 81 = 504\n- T(12) = 504 + 274 + 149 = 927\n\nCheck: 504 + 274 = 778, and 778 + 149 = 927.\n\n**927**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":830,"cache_read_input_tokens":8338,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":830},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"807b1a13-8df0-47c3-9757-808d929ce7af","uuid":"c74fe4b9-347d-4376-a3be-00e71acb43bc","timestamp":"2026-11-19T21:04:47.355Z","request_id":"req_011ChCxxowKQ6TDzRseGt3jR"}
